<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: SOCCER-IVORY COAST BEAT BENIN 1-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-IVORY COAST BEAT BENIN 1-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BOUAKE, Ivory Coast 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivory Coast beat</p>
<p>Benin 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in an African Nations Cup group two</p>
<p>qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Guel Tchiressoa 12</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
</text>
